# GitHub Linguist language-detection overrides.
#
# This is a Kubernetes-manifests repo: ~93% of it is YAML. But Linguist classifies YAML as a
# "data" language, and data/prose types are excluded from the language bar by default — which
# left only the Dockerfile ("programming") counted, showing a misleading "100% Dockerfile".
# Force YAML to be counted so the stats reflect the repo accurately.
*.yaml linguist-detectable=true
*.yml  linguist-detectable=true
